WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:07.643
Send newsletters from your own free account

2
00:00:14.285 --> 00:00:19.130
Sign up at resend.com

3
00:00:19.637 --> 00:00:27.703
Make an API key

4
00:00:28.215 --> 00:00:33.956
Give it Full access

5
00:00:08.153 --> 00:00:34.462
Newsletters can go out on your own free Resend account. It comes with 3,000 emails a month.

6
00:00:34.464 --> 00:00:40.568
Back in the Desk, open Readers and find Send on your own free Resend account.

7
00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:55.144
Paste your key, then type a domain you own. A mail address on it works well, like mail.yourname.com.

8
00:00:55.146 --> 00:01:04.749
Resend gives you three DNS records. Copy each one into your domain's DNS settings. In Cloudflare, turn the proxy off.

9
00:01:04.751 --> 00:01:11.702
Then click Check. Records can take a few minutes to show up.

10
00:01:11.705 --> 00:01:17.107
Verified. Your newsletters now go out from your own address, and replies still come to you.
